<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" article-type="correction" xml:lang="EN"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">PLoS Comput Biol</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">plos</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="pmc">ploscomp</journal-id><journal-title>PLoS Computational Biology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">1553-734X</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1553-7358</issn><publisher><publisher-name>Public Library of Science</publisher-name><publisher-loc>San Francisco, USA</publisher-loc></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2651598</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/annotation/be4eb7dd-4092-49c1-a619-e8eeba40ed67</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Correction: Classifying RNA-Binding Proteins Based on Electrostatic Properties</article-title><alt-title alt-title-type="running-head">Correction</alt-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Shazman</surname><given-names>Shula</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Mandel-Gutfreund</surname><given-names>Yael</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="collection"><month>8</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><!-- Fake ppub added to accomodate plos workflow change from 03/2008 --><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>8</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>21</day><month>8</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><volume>4</volume><issue>8</issue><elocation-id>10.1371/annotation/be4eb7dd-4092-49c1-a619-e8eeba40ed67</elocation-id><copyright-statement>Public Library of Science. This is an open-access article distributed                under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution License, which permits unrestricted use,                distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original work is properly cited.</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2008</copyright-year><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="4" page="e1000146" id="N0x1c54a50N0x1d59320" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="18716674" ext-link-type="pubmed"><article-title>Classifying RNA-Binding Proteins Based on Electrostatic Properties</article-title></related-article></article-meta></front><body><p>In Table 2, the headings F-test and T-test were swapped in the second and third columns. The second column should be T-test and the third should be F-test. Please see the corrected Table 2 here:</p><fig id="pcbi-be4eb7dd-4092-49c1-a619-e8eeba40ed67-g001" position="float"><label/><graphic xlink:href="pcbi.be4eb7dd-4092-49c1-a619-e8eeba40ed67.g001"/></fig></body></article>